'''Stillward Church''' is a [[Horde]]-aligned outpost located in eastern [[Gilneas]].

The hills of Stillward were the site of the final battle in [[Gilneas (kingdom)|Gilneas]]' war of independence, where King [[Garalon Greymane]] and the nascent Gilnean army clashed with the [[Arathor|Arathorian]] army led by King [[Thoradin III]].<ref>[[The First Greymane]]</ref>

